+2. Populate the writer secret out of band
+3. Snowflake provisioning apply for the direct-write objects
+4. Snowflake access apply for the loader stage/table/procedure grants
+5. dbt deployment of business-facing Gold models and dynamic tables
+6. Streamlit artifact upload
 
 This keeps AWS `terraform apply` limited to passive cloud infrastructure.
 
